Subject: Re: [stan-dev] refactor coupled_ode_system to use ode_system
Message-ID: <vjM5siFfxwY.xkPv1tVDCgAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <vjM5siFfxwY.GGAo9dEJCgAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <vjM5siFfxwY.RpaCDDjRCQAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com> <vjM5siFfxwY.GGAo9dEJCgAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-dev/c/vjM5siFfxwY/m/xkPv1tVDCgAJ>
