From ua5e83218c834e013 at groups.google.com  Wed Aug 10 18:02:36 2016
From: ua5e83218c834e013 at groups.google.com (Michael Betancourt)
Date: Wed, 10 Aug 2016 18:02:36 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] faster adaptation
Message-ID: <pKHQczLbNJI.wo-W7O2gCwAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
