Subject: Re: Structured linear algebra etc
Message-ID: <pGKmkrfZt1Y.fQFs188gDQAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <pGKmkrfZt1Y.1o4ODgQdDAAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
