From ub998e9d6a5be0399 at groups.google.com  Tue Aug 16 14:20:32 2016
From: ub998e9d6a5be0399 at groups.google.com (Charles Margossian)
Date: Tue, 16 Aug 2016 14:20:32 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] Complex ODE Based Models wiki: suggestions
Message-ID: <XZJux6x8Roo.TPu2PUtsDQAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <XZJux6x8Roo.xb6KMBpaDQAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <XZJux6x8Roo.xKjHb2xJDQAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com> <XZJux6x8Roo.xb6KMBpaDQAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-dev/c/XZJux6x8Roo/m/TPu2PUtsDQAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
