Hi Sebastian,

As Bob mentioned, it's OK with conditional builds. See the Math / Stan / CmdStan makefiles in each of those repos and in make/os_*. We're doing conditional builds now.

For the Intel Compiler, we can just add settings that only apply when using Intel.

For the tests -- if you need to add that to the tests, we should update the manual. I think you might have written that part about MKL, so please feel free to update it.

What would you suggest happens so that this works? I looked into the licenses a while ago and it looked like we'd have to pay to have it. We don't have that many users asking for it, so it's much less priority for me to maintain the code for yet another compiler.

Daniel

