Hi!

Let's go in steps here:

1. Ensure in the built system that the intel compiler is called with the right options

2. Include in the build system a flag for having the MKL which allows to instruct Eigen to use MKL as well

3. Evaluate the performance gain for CVODES when using the MKL; only if this is promising, we decide for keeping this

However, in any case I do not think that we need to have travis changed or any of the test systems. The reason being that not many users will use the MKL and hence this is not of such a major concern. Nonetheless, I will run once in a while tests on our MKL installation. Does that make sense?

Sebastian

